  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementing Cash Transfers as Early Actions to El-Nino-induced drought in Mberengwa District</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will implement cash transfers to identified vulnerable households in Mberengwa District (Midlands Province) to mitigate the negative impacts of the current El Nino induced drought on vulnerable livelihoods and prevent the adoption of negative coping strategies (such as reduction of quantities and quality of food, early marriages, dropping out children out of school).</narrative>
  </description>
